  "title": "How Can I Get My Wooden Parts Delivered as Fast as Possible?",
  "summary": "When ordering your wooden parts, you will need to consider the total time it takes to order the raw material, produce the parts and then deliver them to your desired location. This is called the lead time and depends on a number of factors. These 6 tips will help you ensure that this lead time is as short as possible.",
